      "writtenOn": "2022-09-09T23:45:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we hardcode cr50 to use uint64_t for ccd_caps_current and ccd_caps_default instead of basing it on the CAP_COUNT?\n\nAnd add a build assert if the cap count goes too high?\n\nAlso add a comment not to change the ccd_info_response in cr50 without changing ti50.",
